# Hostinger hPanel — Environment Variables for the unified marena.alp-see.com app

Set these in: Websites → marena.alp-see.com → Node.js app → Settings → Environment Variables

Total: 18 keys. HOST and PORT are set by Hostinger automatically — do NOT add them.

```
APP_KEYS                              = k1,k2,k3,k4
API_TOKEN_SALT                        = salt-api-marena-2026
ADMIN_JWT_SECRET                      = jwt-marena-2026
TRANSFER_TOKEN_SALT                   = transfer-marena-2026
ENCRYPTION_KEY                        = enc-marena-2026
PUBLIC_URL                            = https://marena.alp-see.com
DATABASE_CLIENT                       = mysql
DATABASE_HOST                         = 127.0.0.1
DATABASE_PORT                         = 3306
DATABASE_NAME                         = u506698511_marena_cms
DATABASE_USERNAME                     = u506698511_marena_cms
DATABASE_PASSWORD                     = w4P55n5UhG$
DATABASE_SSL                          = false
REVALIDATE_SECRET                     = mr-9d2e-f8a1-marena-bali-2026
FRONTEND_REVALIDATE_URL               = https://marena.alp-see.com/api/revalidate
NODE_ENV                              = production
STRAPI_URL                            = https://marena.alp-see.com
STRAPI_API_TOKEN                      = (fill in after first deploy, see below)
```

After first deploy:
1. Visit https://marena.alp-see.com/admin
2. Create admin user
3. Settings → API Tokens → Create new (Read-only, no expiration)
4. Copy token, paste as STRAPI_API_TOKEN value, redeploy.